WHAT THIS COVERS

This repository contains sample output from a generative engine — the SVG files under
samples/sigils/ and samples/sigils-black/, the contact sheet, and the WAV files under
samples/audio/ — together with the accompanying documentation.

The engine itself is not published here and is not covered by this license.

WHAT YOU MAY DO

You may view, download and study these samples. You may reference them in commentary, review or
discussion of this work, with attribution to Nthnkr "dpna" and AmandaBT and a link to this
repository.

WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

The samples are published so that the work can be evaluated. They are not published for reuse.
Without prior written permission you may not:

  - redistribute them, altered or unaltered, as your own work or as part of any collection;
  - use them in any commercial context, including print, merchandise, tattooing, engraving or
    client work;
  - use them as training data for machine learning models of any kind;
  - register them, or any derivative of them, as a trademark or claim authorship of them.

The prohibitions on redistribution, model training and authorship claims are absolute and are not
lifted by any permission granted for other use.

NO WARRANTY

These files are provided as is, without warranty of any kind. This is a research prototype in
active development; the samples reflect a state of the work at a moment in time and are not
guaranteed to be stable, correct or fit for any purpose.

